turn {'chat': 145, 'human': 'Fatima', 'date': '2012,Dec,24', 'turn': 3, 'speaker': 'agent', 'utterance': "Insulin resistance is when your body's cells don't respond properly to the insulin your pancreas produces. This causes your pancreas to produce more insulin to compensate. Over time, it can't keep up, leading to higher blood sugar levels, which is the central issue in Type 2 Diabetes."}
